8. Let the applicant Sanu be released on bail in aforesaid FIR number on his furnishing a personal bond with two sureties of Rs.20,000/- each to the satisfaction of court concerned with the following conditions:
(a) The applicant shall execute a bond to undertake to attend the hearings;
Sanu vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Lko.

